DXVK_ASYNC=2 for the 64-bit DXVK (Gcenx DXVK-macOS 1.10.3 async): compile in the background
also for render targets first bound this frame, as our 32-bit DXVK does. Apply after
dxvk-d3d9-x64.patch. Build with -Db_ndebug=true.

diff --git a/src/dxvk/dxvk_context.cpp b/src/dxvk/dxvk_context.cpp
